    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Fit species-specific logarithmic spiral angles to standardized horn centerlines for the named Oryx, Capra and Ovis taxa and test the stated ordering and approximate values. Nonlogarithmic fits, angles outside uncertainty bounds or a reversed ordering would refute the claim.";
